@startuml A10-class-design
!pragma layout smetana
title A10 回访类图（九职责类已确认；已有类标灰）
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam classBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam classBorderColor #2563EB
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
hide empty members
top to bottom direction

package "ExperimentCore · 标准 C++20 / Linux GCC13" {
class "experiment::ExperimentSession" as Session #F1F5F9 {
  唯一 Phase / LockedBranch / 两项送达位
  + NotifyRevisitContent(fact)
  + GetRevisitProgress() : readonly
}
class "experiment::RevisitRules" as Rules {
  + SelectNext(sample, progress, cursor)
  + EvaluateInterruption(job, sample)
  + EvaluateNudge(cursor, sample)
  + EvaluateDelivery(job, receipt, sample)
}
}

package "UE · 世界与内容适配" {
class "UExperimentSubsystem" as Subsystem #F1F5F9 {
  核心调用 / 效果串行执行
  + QueueFact(context, delivery)
}
class "AExperimentWorldDirector" as Director #F1F5F9 {
  Run / Epoch / Token / 联合布局凭据
  + VerifyWorldReady()
  + CompleteControlRestore()
}
class "URevisitConfig" as Config <<UDataAsset>> {
  三方向 / 内容 ID / FText / 版本
  布局资源 / 范围 / 可读政策
  + ValidateContentSet()
}
class "URevisitLayoutComponent" as Layout <<UActorComponent>> {
  唯一人物与教场装配作业
  + PrepareLayout()
  + CapturePreparedLayout()
  + ValidateBindings()
  + ResetLayout()
}
class "ARevisitParticipantActor" as Actor <<AActor>> {
  StoryPersonId / Entity / Role / Binding
  网格 + 真实接触，无 Combatant
  + BindParticipant()
  + CaptureAnchor()
  + Retire()
}
class "URevisitNarrativeComponent" as Narrative <<UActorComponent>> {
  唯一播放作业 / 接近与挽留游标
  不保存两项完成位
  + BindRevisit()
  + AdvanceNarrative()
  + AcceptReceipt()
  + CancelCurrent()
}
class "FRevisitDataMapper" as Mapper <<无状态>> {
  + ToWorldSample()
  + ToContentDescriptor()
  + ToPresentationSample()
}
Layout --> Actor : 唯一装配 / 退役
Director *-- Layout
Director *-- Narrative
Layout --> Config
Narrative --> Mapper
Narrative ..> Layout : 当前实体 / 内容绑定
}

package "非模态呈现 · 音效与语音实现留 A13" {
class "URevisitPresentationComponent" as Presentation <<UActorComponent>> {
  当前 UI 句柄 / 玩家与视口代次
  + BeginCover() / BeginReveal(proof)
  + PresentSegment(key, content)
  + CapturePresentationSample()
  + CancelPresentation()
}
class "UTimeSkipWidget" as Mask <<UUserWidget>> {
  全视口遮罩 / 中性时间文字
  实际覆盖采样 / 显式固定终态
}
class "URevisitDialogueWidget" as Dialogue <<UUserWidget>> {
  当前完整片段 / 说话者
  文本布局采样，不获取输入焦点
}
Presentation *-- Mask
Presentation *-- Dialogue
}

Subsystem *-up- Session
Director --> Subsystem : 三 Ready / 实际控制恢复
Narrative --> Subsystem : 合法关键回执 → 唯一类型化事实
Narrative .up.> Rules : 冻结值 → 纯计划
Director *-- Presentation
Narrative --> Presentation : 单通道请求 / 先失效再取消
Presentation --> Narrative : 绑定完整身份的回执
Presentation --> Config : 只读呈现配置

note bottom of Layout
A09 环境＋A10 布置
共用 Director 最终 LayoutRevision / A07 BuildKey
Ready 后变更使本地凭据失效
end note
note bottom of Narrative
Completed / Interrupted / Canceled 互斥终态
先封存 Completed → 排队事实 → Session 提交
再读新进度选择下一段
end note
note bottom of Presentation
Widget 不直接发 Ready 或完成事实
Stop 的 finished 不等于自然完成
文本灰盒不冒充最终语音交付
end note
@enduml
